---
name: Nova Halle
tagline: Ambient techno built from field recordings and broken tape
shortBio: >-
  Nova Halle makes ambient techno out of degraded tape and field recordings
  gathered around the Rotterdam docks. Her live set runs entirely without a
  laptop, built on a rack of hardware she has been rewiring since 2019. She has
  released on two European labels and performs across the Benelux and Germany.
